      "title": "M城传说·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "33001001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "优纪，还在烦恼周年庆典的事吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "艾伦建议各自给主人准备礼物，大家也都接受了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "但是.....但是我还是想不出要准备什么！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "单单让主人高兴还不够，必须给|102|制造惊喜才行！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "高兴和惊喜，难道不是大同小异吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "当然不是！我想让主人「喜出望外」，就像这样——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001007",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇啊！......唔、哎？呜啊啊啊啊啊——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "优纪这种状态，不是「喜出望外」，应该叫「大惊失色」才对？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "石、石头，表演胸口碎大石用的石头在动！\n不仅在动，好像还在说话！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001010",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "石头",
          "text": "呜呜呜，我死得好惨啊——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "凄厉的哭声......的确是从石头上传来的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33001012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "难、难道说，闹鬼了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-743",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "qiluo",
          "rowIds": [
            33001001,
            33001002,
            33001003,
            33001004,
            33001005,
